  "description": "Available on a first come / first serve basis, this unique Double Peak Sport 27.5\" model comes only in a sage colorway with a new MicroSHIFT 1x8 Acolyte group as an updated version to our 2021 model. Offered as a user-friendly 1x8 model with single Narrow-Wide 30T chainring and a rear derailleur with clutch to prevent chain-drops, this new Double Peak Sport model features the look of a high-end MTB and performance to match at an affordable price.\nDouble Peak X6 Series aluminum frame w/ tapered head tube\nHL VAXA 30S / 595 HLO 100mm travel fork\nAluminum crankset, 30T, 1x8-speed\nMicroSHIFT Acolyte rear derailleur w/ SpringLock clutch\nMicroSHIFT Acolyte Xpress shifter, 8-speed\nMicroSHIFT Acolyte 12-42T, 8-Speed cassette\nJoytech alloy 6-Bolt Disc hubs, 32h\nMX-21 27.5\"x27mm aluminum DW rims\nRadius DS-100H Hydraulic disc brakeset\nKenda Aptor 27.5x2.35\" tires\nStainless BED spokes",
